error[RB0232]: the value of `meta` key `sla` is not a literal
 --> RB0232-meta-value.road:6:17
  |
6 |     meta { sla: limit, level: Level.High, timeout: 30s, ratio: 1 + 2, ok: -1 }
  |                 ^^^^^
  |
  = help: a `meta` value is a string, int, float or bool written out, such as `"payments"`, `30`, `-0.5` or `true`; it is data about the state, never computed

